```css
@layer reset, tokens, base, components, utilities;

@layer tokens {
  :root {
    --space-2: 0.5rem; --space-4: 1rem;
    --color-text: #1f2937; --color-accent: #1d4ed8; --color-error: #b91c1c;
    --radius: 0.5rem; --font-body: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --color-text: #f3f4f6; } }
}
@layer components {
  .btn { padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius); min-height: 2.75rem; }
  .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
}
```

| Deliverable | Proof |
|---|---|
| token layer. | light/dark/contrast values, measured. |
| components. | only tokens, no stray hex values. |
| state gallery. | default, hover, focus, error, disabled, long text, narrow. |
| compatibility. | written target matrix + tested fallbacks. |
| audit. | keyboard, zoom, reduced motion, forced colours. |
| README. | how to use tokens and components; non-goals. |

